    "updated_at": "2022-08-31T17:51:16Z",
    "body": "Oh, there still are these odd web visible optimizations. I'm of course ok with those if one can't observe them.\r\nBut I'm not ok spec'ing them since they break observing mutations.\r\nIn the old days webkit, IIRC, had something similar for .innerHTML.\r\n\r\nGecko does reuse text node in certain cases, but not with .textContent.",
